{"page":145,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:131","surah":6,"ayah":131,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ أَن لَّمْ يَكُن رَّبُّكَ مُهْلِكَ ٱلْقُرَىٰ بِظُلْمٍ وَأَهْلُهَا غَـٰفِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"your Lord would not destroy towns for their wrongdoing if they had not been warned.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That (is because)","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَكُن","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"yakun","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَّبُّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُهْلِكَ","en_gloss":"one who destroys","transliteration":"muh'lika","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","en_gloss":"the cities","transliteration":"l-qurā","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِظُلْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for (their) wrongdoing","transliteration":"biẓul'min","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَهْلُهَا","en_gloss":"while their people","transliteration":"wa-ahluhā","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":10,"ar":"غَـٰفِلُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) unaware","transliteration":"ghāfilūna","verse_key":"6:131"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٣١","en_gloss":"(131)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:131"}]},{"verse_key":"6:132","surah":6,"ayah":132,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِكُلٍّ دَرَجَـٰتٌ مِّمَّا عَمِلُوا۟ ۚ وَمَا رَبُّكَ بِغَـٰفِلٍ عَمَّا يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everyone is assigned a rank according to their deeds; your Lord is not unaware of anything they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِكُلٍّۢ","en_gloss":"And for all","transliteration":"walikullin","verse_key":"6:132"},{"pos":2,"ar":"دَرَجَـٰتٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will be) degrees","transliteration":"darajātun","verse_key":"6:132"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"6:132"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"they did","tr