 فَسَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ مَن تَكُونُ لَهُۥ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلدَّارِ ۗ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُفْلِحُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], say, ‘My people, you carry on as you are, and so will I: you will come to realize who will have a happy homecoming in the Hereafter.’ The evildoers will not prosper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transliteration":"yāqawmi","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱعْمَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Work","transliteration":"iʿ'malū","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَكَانَتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your position","transliteration":"makānatikum","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I am","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَامِلٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"a worker","transliteration":"ʿāmilun","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","en_gloss":"And soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"you will know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَكُونُ","en_gloss":"will have","transliteration":"takūnu","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for himself","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(in) the end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلدَّارِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(a good) home","transliteration":"l-dāri","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed [he]","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يُفْلِحُ","en_gloss":"succeed","transliteration":"yuf'liḥu","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","verse_key":"6:135"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٣٥","en_gloss":"(135)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:135"}]},{"verse_key":"6:136","surah":6,"ayah":136,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَعَلُوا۟ لِلَّهِ مِمَّا ذَرَأَ مِنَ ٱلْحَرْثِ وَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ نَصِيبًا فَقَالُوا۟ هَـٰذَا لِلَّهِ بِزَعْمِهِمْ وَهَـٰذَا لِشُرَكَآئِنَا ۖ فَمَا كَانَ لِشُرَكَآئِهِمْ فَلَا يَصِلُ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ ۖ وَمَا كَانَ لِلَّهِ فَهُوَ يَصِلُ إِلَىٰ شُرَكَآئِهِمْ ۗ سَآءَ مَا يَحْكُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They apportion to God a share of the produce and the livestock He created, saying, ‘This is for God’- so they claim!- ‘ and this is for our idols.’ Their idols’ share does not reach God, but God’s share does reach their idols: how badly they judge!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَعَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they assign","transliteration":"wajaʿalū","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"out of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ذَرَأَ","en_gloss":"He produced","transliteration":"dhara-a","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْحَرْثِ","en_gloss":"the crops","transliteration":"l-ḥarthi","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"and the cattle","transliteration":"wal-anʿāmi","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَصِيبًۭا","en_gloss":"a share","transliteration":"naṣīban","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they say","transliteration":"faqālū","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(is) for Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِزَعْمِهِمْ","en_gloss":"by their claim","transliteration":"bizaʿmihim","verse_key":"6:136"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"And