كَآؤُهُمْ لِيُرْدُوهُمْ وَلِيَلْبِسُوا۟ عَلَيْهِمْ دِينَهُمْ ۖ وَلَوْ شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ مَا فَعَلُوهُ ۖ فَذَرْهُمْ وَمَا يَفْتَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In the same way, their idols have induced many of the pagans to kill their own children, bringing them ruin and confusion in their faith: if God had willed otherwise they would not have done this, so [Prophet] leave them to their own devices.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And likewise","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":2,"ar":"زَيَّنَ","en_gloss":"made pleasing","transliteration":"zayyana","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِكَثِيرٍۢ","en_gloss":"to many","transliteration":"likathīrin","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists ","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَتْلَ","en_gloss":"(the) killing","transliteration":"qatla","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْلَـٰدِهِمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their children ","transliteration":"awlādihim","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شُرَكَآؤُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their partners ","transliteration":"shurakāuhum","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِيُرْدُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may ruin them","transliteration":"liyur'dūhum","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلِيَلْبِسُوا۟","en_gloss":"and that they make confusing","transliteration":"waliyalbisū","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":12,"ar":"دِينَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their religion","transliteration":"dīnahum","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"(had) willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:137"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مَ